{
  "id": "supported-living",
  "term": "supported living",
  "definition": "Supported living is a housing arrangement where a person lives in accommodation that includes some ongoing support or supervision. In this context, it refers to post-discharge living placements for people leaving forensic psychiatric services, where the stability of the arrangement and help with medication administration may matter.",
